<% layout('layouts/boilerplates.ejs') %>

<main class="legal-page">
    <div class="legal-header">
        <p class="listings-eyebrow"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i> Fresh Haven</p>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p>Last updated: September 19, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <article class="legal-content">
        <p>Fresh Haven helps people discover and share stays. This policy explains what information the application collects and how it is used.</p>

        <h2>Information you provide</h2>
        <p>When you create an account, we store your username, email address, and password credentials. Passwords are processed through the authentication system and are not stored as plain text.</p>
        <p>When you create a listing or review, we store the information you submit, including listing details, images, ratings, comments, and the username associated with your account.</p>

        <h2>How we use information</h2>
        <p>We use account information to authenticate you, associate your listings and reviews with your account, and provide the application features you request. We use listing and review content to display the marketplace and community feedback.</p>

        <h2>Sessions and security</h2>
        <p>Fresh Haven uses a session cookie to keep you signed in while you use the application. You should keep your login details private and log out when using a shared device.</p>

        <h2>Sharing and retention</h2>
        <p>Your username, listings, and reviews may be visible to other visitors. We do not sell your personal information. Account and content data are retained while your account or the related content remains in the application.</p>

        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>You can update or delete listings you own and delete reviews you authored. To request account-related help or correction of your information, contact the Fresh Haven administrator.</p>

        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this policy when the application changes. The latest version will always be available on this page.</p>
    </article>
</main>
